{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"因明正理門論本校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"一．是書校歴三週.一譯校.二類校.三刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"二．譯校對勘.凡用兩種異本。（一）西藏金鎧等譯集量論釋引文.校註略稱集量金","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"本。（二）西藏寶持護等譯同釋引文。略稱集量寶本。兩種並擧則稱集量二本。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"三．譯校凡有三例。（一）集量引文歧異者.皆註出曰.勘集量某本雲雲。（二）引文意","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"義較暢者.皆註出曰.勘集量某本意謂雲雲。（三）因對勘而見奘譯改文或訛略","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"者.皆註出曰.勘集量某本雲雲.今譯雲雲。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"四．舊稱義淨譯因明正理門論爲本書異譯.今勘其文.祗有卷首一段係淨所出.餘","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"仍奘譯.偶有異字皆係寫改.今卽附錄首段於末備考。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"五．類校用玄奘譯因明入正理論及西藏失譯因明入正理門論.勘有文句類同可","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"資參證者.皆註出曰.勘入論雲雲.或入論藏本雲雲。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"六．刻校用南宋刻爲底本.對勘麗刻.校正文字.附註曰.原刻雲雲.依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"本頁圖像********************","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"七．今刊款式.以有釋之本頌頂格.複述之重頌及略例之攝頌低格.又長行中外人","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"徵難用⊙絕句以醒眉目。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"八．校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"(一)西藏譯集量論釋.tshad-makun-lusbtus-pah!i-h!grel-pa.金本.丹珠經","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"解部.奈旦版.Ce字函一三四頁上至九六面下.寶本.同函九六頁下至一八〇","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"頁上.又曲尼版.ce字函一四頁下至八五頁下。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"(二)義淨譯因明正理門論.日本大正大藏經本。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"(三)玄奘譯因明入正理論.金陵刻經處刊本。〈大疏牒本〉","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"(四)西藏譯因明入正理門論.tshad-marigs-parh!jug-pah!isgoshes-bya-bah!i","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"rab_tubyed_pa.丹珠經解部.奈旦版.ce字函一八三頁下至一八八頁下。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"(五)本書南宋刻麗刻本.依據日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"校註。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_205_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_205","text":"本頁圖像********************","sortOrder":26}],"overrides":{}}